---
title:    "Type-Oriented Construction of Web User Interfaces"
citation: "(PPDP 2006)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/PPDP06.html"
date:     2006-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper proposes a new technique for the high-level construction
of type-safe web-oriented user interfaces in Curry.
It is integrated as a library ([WUI](http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~pakcs/WUI "Web User Interface"))
in the [PAKCS](http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~pakcs "Portland Aachen Kiel Curry System") programming environment.